    {
      "source": "The default implementation returns <a href=\"../../../core/Ordered.html#LOWEST_PRECEDENCE\"><code>Ordered.LOWEST_PRECEDENCE</code></a>,\nthereby ensuring that custom listeners are ordered after default\nlisteners supplied by the framework.",
